        "content": "\n**Headline finding: there is no test infrastructure at all.** `package.json` has no test runner, no `@testing-library/*`, no `vitest`/`jest`, and there isn't a single `*.test.ts(x)`/`*.spec.ts(x)` file in the repo. Coverage is 0% across ~40 logic-bearing modules. This Next.js version (16) ships only the Vitest guide under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/01-app/02-guides/testing/vitest.md` (no Jest guide) — that's the framework to standardize on.\n\n",
